<tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 8px;"><h1 style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:28px;color:#102a43;margin:0 0 16px;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">Hi Avery,</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">Someone asked to reset the password for this account. The link works once and expires in 1 hour.</p>
<p style="margin:8px 0 24px;"><a href="https://auth.northeasternsga.com/reset-password?token=sample-token" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;display:inline-block;background:#c8102e;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;">Choose a new password</a></p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#52606d;margin:0 0 16px;">If the button doesn't work, copy this link:<br><a href="https://auth.northeasternsga.com/reset-password?token=sample-token" style="color:#52606d;word-break:break-all;">https://auth.northeasternsga.com/reset-password?token=sample-token</a></p>
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">If you didn&#39;t ask for this, ignore this email. Your password won&#39;t change.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#7b8794;padding:16px 32px 24px;border-top:1px solid #e4e7eb;">Replies to this address aren&#39;t read.</td></tr>
</table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
