exports[`rendering > renders security-alert-every-rule with a subject, html and text 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Security alert</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f7fa;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;">SGAuth found conditions that need a look.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f5f7fa;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;">
<tr><td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;color:#c8102e;padding:24px 32px 0;">SGAuth</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 8px;"><h1 style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:28px;color:#102a43;margin:0 0 16px;">Security alert</h1>
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">Hi,</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">The alert check at October 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET found:</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">- 64 failed sign-ins in the last 15 minutes (alert threshold: 50).</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">- 6 accounts locked in the last hour (alert threshold: 5).</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">- Break-glass Primary Admin recovery was used 1 time since April 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET.</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">- 2 Primary Admin transfers started since April 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET.</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">- The token signing keys were rotated 1 time since April 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET.</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">- 3 scheduled job runs failed since April 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET: alerts, pa-transfer.</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">- Upstash was unreachable 4 times since April 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET, so rate limits or email caps were not enforced.</p>

<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">Each condition is reported at most once an hour. If any of this is unexpected, check the audit log and Vercel logs, and see the on-call runbook.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#7b8794;padding:16px 32px 24px;border-top:1px solid #e4e7eb;">Replies to this address aren&#39;t read.</td></tr>
</table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "subject": "SGA Auth security alert: 7 conditions",
  "text": "SGAuth

Security alert

Hi,

The alert check at October 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET found:

- 64 failed sign-ins in the last 15 minutes (alert threshold: 50).

- 6 accounts locked in the last hour (alert threshold: 5).

- Break-glass Primary Admin recovery was used 1 time since April 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET.

- 2 Primary Admin transfers started since April 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET.

- The token signing keys were rotated 1 time since April 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET.

- 3 scheduled job runs failed since April 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET: alerts, pa-transfer.

- Upstash was unreachable 4 times since April 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET, so rate limits or email caps were not enforced.

Each condition is reported at most once an hour. If any of this is unexpected, check the audit log and Vercel logs, and see the on-call runbook.

--
Replies to this address aren't read.",
}
`;

